{"id":6290,"date":"2026-08-05T10:30:00","date_gmt":"2026-08-05T09:30:00","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.jouwweb.nl\/blog\/?p=6290"},"modified":"2026-06-23T12:32:25","modified_gmt":"2026-06-23T11:32:25","slug":"starting-a-business-from-home-in-2026","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/www.webador.com\/blog\/starting-a-business-from-home-in-2026\/","title":{"rendered":"Thinking of starting a business from home in 2026? Check out these business ideas and trends"},"content":{"rendered":"\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Do you dream of being your own boss? Or do you want an extra source of income alongside your current job? Then there\u2019s only one thing you need to do: just get started!<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Thanks to online tools, social media, and e-commerce, you can now build a business right from your living room. You often don\u2019t need a large startup budget, and you can grow at your own pace.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">But where do you start? And what ideas are worth exploring for aspiring entrepreneurs? In this blog, we\u2019ll share business ideas you can easily launch from home.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"height:80px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"><\/div>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Why more and more people Are running their own businesses from home<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">More and more entrepreneurs are choosing to work from home. That\u2019s not surprising, because it gives you so much freedom!<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Plus, the internet offers a huge opportunity. With a professional website and an active online presence, you can reach customers Worldwide!<\/p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons is-content-justification-center is-layout-flex wp-container-core-buttons-is-layout-fe48e5de wp-block-buttons-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"https:\/\/www.webador.com\/\">Build your own professional website here<\/a><\/div>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"height:80px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"><\/div>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">6 Business Ideas You Can Start<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">1. Start an online store selling handmade products<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Are you creative? Then you can turn your hobby into a business. Customers are increasingly appreciating unique, handmade products\u2014precisely because they\u2019re looking for something personal that not everyone has. For example:<\/p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Jewelry<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Candles<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Illustrations<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Personalized gifts<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Clothing<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"height:40px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"><\/div>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">2. Sell digital products<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Digital products are popular because you create them once and can then sell them indefinitely. Examples include:<\/p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>E-books<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Templates<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Workbooks<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Digital planners<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"height:20px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"><\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons is-content-justification-center is-layout-flex wp-container-core-buttons-is-layout-fe48e5de wp-block-buttons-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"https:\/\/help.webador.com\/hc\/en-us\/articles\/29426751861393-Sell-digital-products-or-services\">Read here to find out how you can sell your digital products with Webador<\/a><\/div>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"height:40px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"><\/div>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">3. Offer online courses<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Do you have expertise in a particular subject? If so, you can share it through online courses. These can cover photography, marketing, music, language instruction, accounting, or virtually any other field. More and more people are learning online, which means the demand for high-quality courses continues to grow.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"height:40px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"><\/div>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">4. Freelancer<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">These days, many companies hire freelancers for temporary assignments. For example:<\/p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Copywriting <\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Graphic Design<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Translation<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Customer Service<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Administrative Support<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"height:40px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"><\/div>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">5. Start a blog based on your expertise<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Blogging is still a great way to build an online business. Choose a topic you know a lot about or are passionate about. Think about entrepreneurship, travel, health, interior design, sustainability, etc.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">A blog helps people find your business more easily.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"height:40px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"><\/div>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">6. Offer online coaching<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Are you good at guiding people? If so, coaching might be something for you. Online sessions make it possible to help clients across the country. More and more people are seeking online support in the following areas:<\/p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Health<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Nutrition<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Productivity<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Career Development<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Personal Growth<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"height:80px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"><\/div>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">What are the key entrepreneurship trends for 2026?<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>Personal brands are becoming more important<\/strong><br>People are increasingly buying from those they feel comfortable with. They want to know who is behind a company and what your story is.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>Authentic content<\/strong><br>Customers appreciate authenticity. A genuine video or personal story often works better than a post that\u2019s just a little too perfect.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>AI will be a tool, not a replacement<\/strong><br>AI tools can help entrepreneurs with writing, brainstorming, designing, and planning. However, it\u2019s your knowledge, creativity, and personality that will make the difference.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>Online visibility remains essential<\/strong><br>Whether you sell products or offer services, customers will always look for you online. That\u2019s why visibility remains important, and this trend will only continue to grow in the coming years.<br><strong><br><\/strong><\/p>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"height:80px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"><\/div>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Why having your own website remains essential<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Social media is a great way to reach new customers, but a website remains the foundation of your online presence. It\u2019s where you:<\/p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Tells a story<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Showcases products or services<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Introduces customers to your brand<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Can be found on Google<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Generates sales\/leads<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"height:40px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"><\/div>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Ready to turn your idea into reality?<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Starting a business from home will be more accessible than ever in 2026. Whether you want to sell products, offer services, or share your expertise, there are plenty of opportunities to turn an idea into a real business.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group has-light-gray-background-color has-background\"><div class=\"wp-block-group__inner-container is-layout-flow wp-block-group-is-layout-flow\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns is-not-stacked-on-mobile is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-8f761849 wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-center is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"maak-nu-jouw-website-met-jouwweb\">Build your website with Webador today!<\/h3>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\" style=\"flex-basis:30%\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons is-content-justification-right is-layout-flex wp-container-core-buttons-is-layout-89b4c9e9 wp-block-buttons-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-button alignright\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"\/?utm_source=jouwweb-blog&amp;utm_medium=referral&amp;utm_campaign=cta-blok#signup-modal\">Start now<\/a><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Do you dream of being your own boss? Or do you want an extra source of income alongside your current job? Then there\u2019s only one thing you need to do: just get started! Thanks to online tools, social media, and e-commerce, you can now build a business right from your living room. You often don\u2019t&hellip;<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":21,"featured_media":6309,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"open","sticky":false,"template":"","format":"standard","meta":{"inline_featured_image":false,"footnotes":""},"categories":[35],"tags":[],"class_list":["post-6290","post","type-post","status-publish","format-standard","has-post-thumbnail